Package: shiny.val.tools
Title: Create Per-Feature Validation Artifacts for Shiny Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Vedha",
             family = "Viyash",
             email = "vedha@appsilon.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person(given = "Appsilon Sp. z o.o.",
             email = "opensource@appsilon.com",
             role = "cph"))
Description: Static-analysis tooling that produces per-feature validation
    artifacts for Shiny apps in pharma/GxP contexts. Slices a Shiny app's
    reactive graph into output-rooted feature subgraphs and emits, for each
    feature, an interactive subgraph widget, a function-centric inventory,
    a derived package list, and a documentation stub. Supports traditional
    Shiny ('library' + 'source') and rhino ('box::use') patterns.
